# Lepton x86_64 release signing keys (OpenSSH allowed_signers format).
#
# The release manager (Lepton: Install / Update / Repair) trusts the keys
# listed here. While this file lists no key, releases are verified by checksum
# only and the user must confirm before a downloaded installer runs; once a
# key is listed, unsigned or wrongly signed releases are refused.
#
# One line per key:
#   lepton-release namespaces="lepton-release" ssh-ed25519 AAAA... lepton-release-YYYY
# Optional valid-after="YYYYMMDD" / valid-before="YYYYMMDD" options support key
# rotation. See RELEASING.md ("Release signing"). Never put a private key here.
